  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Add <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/Printer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Printer</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/Parser.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Parser</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/Formatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Formatter</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterFactory</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/GenericConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>GenericConverter</code></a>, and beans from the specified\nbean factory.",
      "translation": "添加来自指定 bean 工厂的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/Printer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Printer</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/Parser.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Parser</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/Formatter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Formatter</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterFactory</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/GenericConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>GenericConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>registry</code> - the registry of converters to add to (must also be castable to\nConversionService, e.g. being a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/ConfigurableConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>ConfigurableConversionService</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>registry</code> - 要添加转换器的注册表（还必须可转换为 ConversionService，例如是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/ConfigurableConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>ConfigurableConversionService</code></a>)",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassCastException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">ClassCastException</a></code> - if the given ConverterRegistry could not be cast to a\nConversionService",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassCastException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">ClassCastException</a></code> - 如果给定的 ConverterRegistry 无法转换为 ConversionService",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>registry</code> - the service to register beans with",
      "translation": "<code>registry</code> - 用于注册 Bean 的服务。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the bean factory to get the beans from",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 用于获取 Bean 的 Bean Factory",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <code>true</code> if objects of <code>sourceType</code> can be converted to the\n<code>targetType</code> and the converter has <code>Object.class</code> as a supported source\ntype.",
      "translation": "如果可以将 <code>sourceType</code> 的对象转换为 <code>targetType</code>，并且转换器支持 <code>Object.class</code> 作为源类型，则返回 <code>true</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/FormatterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>FormatterRegistry</code></a> with formatters and converters\nappropriate for most Spring Boot applications.",
      "translation": "配置给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/FormatterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>FormatterRegistry</code></a>，以适配大多数 Spring Boot 应用程序所需的格式器和转换器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add converters useful for most Spring Boot applications.",
      "translation": "添加对大多数 Spring Boot 应用程序有用的转换器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add formatters useful for most Spring Boot applications.",
      "translation": "添加对大多数 Spring Boot 应用程序有用的格式化程序。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add converters to support delimited strings.",
      "translation": "添加转换器以支持分隔符字符串。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Designed for direct instantiation but also exposes the static\n<a href=\"#addApplicationConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>addApplicationConverters(ConverterRegistry)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#addApplicationFormatters(org.springframework.format.FormatterRegistry)\"><code>addApplicationFormatters(FormatterRegistry)</code></a> utility methods for ad-hoc use\nagainst registry instance.",
      "translation": "专为直接实例化而设计，同时也公开了静态实用方法 <a href=\"#addApplicationConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>addApplicationConverters(ConverterRegistry)</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#addApplicationFormatters(org.springframework.format.FormatterRegistry)\"><code>addApplicationFormatters(FormatterRegistry)</code></a>，以便针对注册表实例进行临时使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: This method actually returns an <a href=\"ApplicationConversionService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>ApplicationConversionService</code></a>\ninstance. However, the <code>ConversionService</code> signature has been preserved for\nbinary compatibility.",
      "translation": "注意：此方法实际上返回一个 <a href=\"ApplicationConversionService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>ApplicationConversionService</code></a> 实例。但是，为了保持二进制兼容性，已保留了 <code>ConversionService</code> 的签名。",
      "count": 2
    },
